Report the sign of portrait presentation from MADCTL and the
physical glass mount. Preserve the native framebuffer, panel writes,
and the legacy logical-orientation property.

diff --git a/hw/m5stopwatch/m5_spi_panel.c b/hw/m5stopwatch/m5_spi_panel.c
